cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "bridge: organism_sim controller over dnalang-core's DD search space with Aer ground truth"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it. Negative results are part of the record."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Davis
    given-names: Devin Phillip
    email: osiris.dnalang@gmail.com
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-09-20
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: https://github.com/osiris-dnalang/bridge
abstract: >-
  Evolutionary controller (organism_sim LCS agent) over dnalang-core's dynamical-
  decoupling search space, evaluated on Aer under quasi-static dephasing and ZZ
  crosstalk implemented as exact unitaries (reproduces the ibm_fez staggered-XY4
  result). Provenance joined across the organism audit chain and the dnalang ledger
  on (genome_key, calibration_hash). Pre-registered results: budget-matched search
  ties the dnalang GA (0.9763 vs 0.9758, staggered XY4 0.9705); calibration-shock
  re-convergence - organism layer FAIL (1/5), controllers re-converge 2-3x faster
  than the population GA (exploratory).
